Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=45}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:47.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\N"Take to the Sky!\NRide the Knockup Stream!"
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Where the heck is that\Nrubbery, bug‐eyed idiot?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.75,0:01:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is just like him!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Didn't we all agree to be\Nhere over 45 minutes ago?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss the current!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.51,0:02:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. I'm sure the genius\Ndidn't even stop to consider
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.93,0:02:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,how the gold would\Nweigh him down.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why does he always insist
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.93,0:02:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on making everything\Nten times harder?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.02,0:02:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe only schedule\NLuffy's concerned with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:15.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is his own.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.27,0:02:17.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He's got a point there.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.18,0:02:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't think someone in\Ntown beat him up, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.89,0:02:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, you mean that guy Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, if Bellamy\Ndidn't beat him up,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.07,0:02:25.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you better believe I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right, tough girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:33.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:40.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look there! He's back.\NI knew he'd make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NLuffy, hurry!\NWe're already behind schedule!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:47.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.77,0:02:49.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLook, it's a Hercules!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It took me forever to find it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:56.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa! That's awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.24,0:03:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Introducing the Going\NMerry flying edition.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It can fly?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.08,0:03:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know! They built\Nit just for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA CREW]\N– Yahoo!\N– Yahoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA CREW laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Morons.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something about it makes\Nme feel kinda uneasy.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, for once I agree with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chickens don't even\Nknow how to fly.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They should've made it a pigeon.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that got to do\Nwith anything, ya dope?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, if you're with me,\Nlet me hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA CREW]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you waitin' for?\NGet on board.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless you plan on missin'\Nyour chance at the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like a fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Thanks for the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank them. They built it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.68,0:03:58.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks for\Nthe ship, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.27,0:04:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can have my Hercules!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NOoh! Really?\NYou mean it? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– That's so kind of you!\N– That's so kind of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.15,0:04:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, enough of\Nthis foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NFollow us! We'll lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NCome on, Luffy! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NComing!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.85,0:04:24.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NThis "City of Gold"\Nis just a fairytale!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.02,0:04:28.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That liar, Noland,\Ndreamt it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saruyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA CREW]\N– Aye!\N– Aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CRICKET]\NI'm counting on you, men.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.04,0:04:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you give our friends here\Neverything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA CREW]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTime to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You heard him. Shove off!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CRICKET]\NWell, kid, looks like\Nthis is where we part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CRICKET]\NThere's only one thing\Nyou gotta remember,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,above everything else.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.47,0:05:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not one person in history\Nhas ever disproved
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the existence of sky island.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,People may say I'm crazy\Nand even laugh at me,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.61,0:05:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a romantic. Like you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Romantic.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Thanks for the gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.40,0:05:53.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And hey, don't be fallin'\Nfrom the sky, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.11,0:05:58.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSee ya around, Pops!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThanks for everything, Cricket!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThink of us when you find
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the City of Gold, old‐timer!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.05,0:06:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTry and take it easy, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.25,0:06:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CRICKET]\NMind your own business!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.30,0:06:20.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NIt's morning already?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.85,0:06:23.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burgess. See anything out there?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BURGESS]\NCan't even see an\Noutline of the shore yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.08,0:06:30.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really think they're\Ngoing to that sky island?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so they say.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.05,0:06:34.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll be pretty tough\Nto follow up there,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.13,0:06:37.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so we gotta take care\Nof 'em before that.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.41,0:06:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NOkay, listen up!\NIt's currently 7:00 am.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.25,0:06:45.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to arrive at our final\Ndestination no later than 11:00.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.08,0:06:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like Cricket\Nalready told us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The spot where the\NKnockup Stream erupts
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is different every single time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.61,0:06:54.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to get there\Nas early as possible
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.19,0:06:57.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in order to pin point\Nit's exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NCheck it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NIt looks like\Nwe're already running
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a little behind schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.57,0:07:05.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you knuckleheads\Npayin' attention?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.69,0:07:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDid you see that?\NIt has to face forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Strange. I've never seen\Na bird quite like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He only faces south,\Nisn't that funny?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.03,0:07:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The goofy bird acts\Njust like a compass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what it said?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said he's going to face a\Ndifferent direction on purpose
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.37,0:07:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and laugh at us once we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.17,0:07:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGo ahead and try!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:32.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. He's really facing north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.99,0:07:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTold ya he couldn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, CHOPPER laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO CREWMAN A]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.85,0:07:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show the boss some respect\Nand pipe down over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. They're fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.16,0:07:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, it reminds me\Nof the old days
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when I was young and irreverent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:59.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh‐oh. What'd they'd say?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.77,0:08:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! There's no point\Ngettin' so worked up, fella.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha‐ha! Try to relax!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.71,0:08:07.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And who put us\Nbehind schedule again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what, he's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Being tense won't\Nget us anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.68,0:08:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We may as well enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.89,0:08:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see your point.\NFull speed ahead, men.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.56,0:08:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyone not relaxing\Nanswers to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO CREW sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAhh. That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA CREW sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.32,0:08:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.06,0:08:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA CREWMAN A]\NBoss! Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.64,0:08:31.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.72,0:08:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see the cumuloregalis cloud!\NTo the southwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NIt can't be! What time is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.02,0:08:38.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA CREWMAN A]\NTen o'clock!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.39,0:08:40.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're a full hour early!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NShojo! Do you\Nthink we can make it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.39,0:08:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NDispatch the Utan Divers!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.39,0:08:47.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Find me those currents!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:52.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThey're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on now?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.49,0:08:56.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cumuloregalis\Nclouds appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:58.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a lot sooner than expected,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.45,0:09:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so now everyone's scrambling\Nto find a current!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:04.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonar waves detected!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a large current\Nat 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO CREWMAN B]\NLarge creature\Ndetected at nine o'clock!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It could be a Sea King!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.05,0:09:19.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's wave activity\Ndetected at ten o'clock
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.60,0:09:20.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,going against the current!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I believe it's a giant\Nwhirlpool, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.17,0:09:26.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it! Full speed ahead\Ndirectly for ten o'clock!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where the Knockup\NStream's gonna erupt,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.15,0:09:29.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.10,0:09:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThe waves are getting higher!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're gonna sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:44.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NSteady, men.\NIt's a pre‐eruption tremor!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.82,0:09:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NEruption?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:49.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Navigator! What\Ndoes the Log Pose say?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pointing straight\Nat those clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYou mean the sky\Nisland's above that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.85,0:09:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wind direction's perfect.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.55,0:10:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The clouds are lining\Nup exactly over
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.09,0:10:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the center of the whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat whirlpool?\NI haven't seen anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.59,0:10:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice work, brother!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think we hit the\Njackpot this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.97,0:10:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! And it seems we're in\Nfor a nice‐sized explosion!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.47,0:10:14.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDo you think we'll make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:15.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NOf course!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.89,0:10:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.06,0:10:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll lead you\Nto the inner edge.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right. But what\Nshould we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Position yourself on the flow\Nand head towards the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:29.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe wants us to go to the center?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't remember\Nsigning up for all this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.90,0:10:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDon't worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure nothing\Nhappens to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI've never seen one\Nquite this big before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:47.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I change my\Nmind! I wanna go back!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.26,0:10:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSorry, Usopp, too late for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"You know who"\Nis already excited.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go! To the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NIt's time for us to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.46,0:11:24.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to\Nyou now! Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys! And thanks\Na lot for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.47,0:11:30.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't go! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:34.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, take me with you!\NGimme a break, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.23,0:11:38.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNo one said anything\Nabout diving head first
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.61,0:11:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into a giant whirlpool!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhy's it getting dark?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOh, no! We're being sucked in!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.72,0:11:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be so unreasonable, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.19,0:11:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go back while\Nwe still have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand\Nthis sky island stuff
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is just a bunch of make‐believe?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not worth\Ngetting us killed!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.82,0:11:56.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all make believe?\NIs that what you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp's right! I think\Nthis is a really bad idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.89,0:12:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt may be a stupid\Ndream, but I have to try.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.94,0:12:05.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It could be our\Ngreatest adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:09.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP, NAMI]\N– No. It's too late.\N– No. It's too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.22,0:12:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Instead of wasting\Nyour time bickering,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you all might wanna take a look.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.93,0:12:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIt's sucking us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHurry, Nami!\NLet my arms protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.82,0:12:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat happened? It disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's goin' on?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWait. I‐I don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.70,0:12:44.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.22,0:12:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThe whirlpool sunk\Nunder the surface.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.88,0:13:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYou don't mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NHold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Zoro?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NWell, well, well.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.09,0:13:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it isn't Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.26,0:13:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him. It's that\NMock Town guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've come all this\Nway to collect
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on your hundred‐\Nmillion‐Berry bounty!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.10,0:13:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.72,0:13:42.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NWere those youngsters\Nexpecting some company?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NI don't know, brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Why's it getting\Ndark out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.12,0:13:54.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hundred million?\NWhat're you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.29,0:13:56.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.03,0:13:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It says right here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.32,0:14:01.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy wanted\Nfor a hundred million.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.95,0:14:06.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And for Pirate Hunter Zoro:\N60 million Berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.30,0:14:09.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true. He's got a different\Nposter for each of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.30,0:14:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro. Congratulations\Non your new bounty! Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWait a minute, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.27,0:14:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on. Do you see one for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like your bounties\Nmust've gone way up
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after the Alabasta incident.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But a hundred million?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.14,0:14:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThis is great!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.32,0:14:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear that? My bounty\Nwent up big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sixty million's not\Ntoo bad either.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.99,0:14:38.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not a good thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.79,0:14:45.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NMake sure to keep your\Neyes open, Going Merry crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:51.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's here. I hope\Nthey're ready for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHOJO]\NBrace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NEveryone hold on or get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:05.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOh, no! The ship!\NIt's being lifted up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP crying]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:47.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA CREWMAN B]\NHelp! We're gonna capsize!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.98,0:15:51.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold steady!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.11,0:15:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let go, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.36,0:16:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA, SHOJO]\N– Go sky island!\N– Go sky island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat's happening?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe're sailing up\Na huge pillar of water!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.87,0:16:08.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThis is awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHow are we doing this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wind.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.55,0:16:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right! I can't\Nbelieve it's finally happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.84,0:16:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on. It's not gonna\Nbe that easy. Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.02,0:16:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, what now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did we\Nforget about something?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThe hull's starting to float!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIf we don't stop it,\Nwe're gonna fall into the ocean!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat do ya expect\Nus to do about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.02,0:16:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're having a hard enough\Ntime holding on as it is,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.42,0:16:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or haven't you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.47,0:16:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThe Sea King!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIs that the one from before?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, it's only a matter of time
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before the same thing\Nhappens to the Merry!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.01,0:16:58.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know! But what can we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.31,0:16:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have a\Nwhole lot of options
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.61,0:17:01.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when it comes to mother nature.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're at her mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI guess we hold on\Nand hope for the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:08.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.27,0:17:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ships are falling from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna end up\Ndriftwood, just like them!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.89,0:17:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're gonna take a nose\Ndive to the bottom of the ocean
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.17,0:17:18.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all because Luffy had to\Nfollow some stupid dream!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.87,0:17:22.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSpread the sails! Right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.21,0:17:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure it's a pillar of water,\Nbut it's still part of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.25,0:17:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a rising current!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.26,0:17:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wind from below is\Na rising air current
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,produced by geothermal heat,\Ncausing a steam explosion!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It may be packaged differently,\Nbut it's still wind and water!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me. I'm a\Nnavigator, aren't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.24,0:17:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThank you, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.66,0:17:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, gang!\NNami's leading the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HATS]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.20,0:17:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAll right, guys,\Ncatch the starboard wind
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.15,0:17:51.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and align the ship\Nwith the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HATS]\N– Yes, ma'am!\N– Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.88,0:17:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're rising up off\Nthe water! Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:18:00.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNami, do something!\NWe're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.97,0:18:02.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on. Do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.86,0:18:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWe're flying!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.89,0:18:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We're headed to the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:16.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Good job!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I love you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.45,0:18:28.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CRICKET]\NGo for it, kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.49,0:18:31.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Always remember\Nto keep dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MASIRA, SHOJO]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIf the wind keeps this up,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.21,0:18:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we can sail as high as we want!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.25,0:18:46.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Are we\Nalmost to Skypiea?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.63,0:18:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it exists, it's\Npast those clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NPast the clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.72,0:18:55.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to find out\Nwhat's up in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.06,0:18:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's bust through\N'em and find out!
